    note = '\n2026-10-10 round-native-lattice-finite: PROGRESS. Nine new modules, 24 proved theorems and five other declarations; 29 exact new reports. All 804 baseline hashes verified before registration; only retained root and registry change. Original open quotient compact representatives, finite actual discrete compact intersections and original preconnected translate overlaps prove actual specified lattice finite generation. Actual original rational bracket scalar restriction and nilpotent lower-central termination give finite seed adjoint words. Genuine Jacobi stabilizer closure proves their span equals the actual generated Lie subalgebra. Actual W=span_Q(Log(Gamma)) equals the Q-Lie span of finite original generator logarithms by true rational BCH and actual group generation; actual W is finite dimensional over Q. Actual real Q-basis independence/full rational form, specified-lattice rational subgroup cocompactness, quantitative bounds, reverse original group/Lie layer comparison, Malcev and full target remain unproved. Retained axiom sets and seven retained axiom-free reports unchanged; actual new axiom-free reports are separately checked. All 795 own and nine attributed PNT+ modules plus root and registry scanned; 813 source/config hashes. Actual complete build and exact kernel totals: ' + str(verified["build_jobs"]) + ' jobs, 4039 exact unique standard-axiom reports, both terminal exit 0. New sources warning-free and oleans current. Fixed local paper and pins match; no remote updates. No unavoidable blocker. Review: round-native-lattice-finite-review.json.\n\n'
